        <summary>
          <para>Still photo capture.</para>
          <para>Optimized for high-quality high-resolution capture, and not expected to maintain preview-like frame rates.</para>
          <para>The stream may have stalls regardless of whether android.control.* is HIGH_QUALITY. This use case has the same behavior as the default JPEG and RAW related formats.</para>
          <para><format type="text/html"><a href="https://developer.android.com/reference/android/hardware/camera2/CameraMetadata#SCALER_AVAILABLE_STREAM_USE_CASES_STILL_CAPTURE" title="Reference documentation">Android reference for <code>android.hardware.camera2.CameraMetadata.SCALER_AVAILABLE_STREAM_USE_CASES_STILL_CAPTURE</code>.</a></format></para>
